WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.850
Narrator: Watch what happens at a narrow gate.

2
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.470
Narrator: The flow squeezes.

3
00:00:04.570 --> 00:00:09.840
Narrator: If people push, everyone gets slower - faster is slower.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.640
Narrator: The crowd bunches into an arch around the gap.

5
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:22.090
Narrator: People cut corners and pack in tight.

6
00:00:22.190 --> 00:00:23.720
Narrator: And on stairs, everything is slower and a fall is more dangerous.

